Landor is looking for a Strategist to join our Chicago studio. Could this be you? &nbsp;

We are Landor, part of WPP

World-leading brand experts,&nbsp;
underpinned by the most expansive strategic &amp; creative capabilities in our category.

We make brands more valuable and less vulnerable.

We build brands differently. We work with our clients to define and solve their business problems through the lens of brand. We strategically join the dots between our design, experience, governance and measurement capabilities, and always connect our brand work to business outcomes.&nbsp;

Landor companies also include amp (sonic branding), bdg (workplace &amp; architectural experts), Deep Local (creative technologists) and ManvsMachine (3D motion design).

About WPP

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&nbsp;in a single company -&nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&nbsp; WPP.com .

&nbsp;

What you’ll do

• Partners with internal teams and, where relevant, WPP partners, to lead research design, execution, and analysis &nbsp;

• Experience &nbsp;the principles of BrandAsset Valuator and can pull out basic data &nbsp;

• Gains and maintains in-depth understanding of client’s business and industry &nbsp;

• Makes the most of AI to maximize knowledge, inspiration and efficiencies &nbsp;

• Owns the development of the client strategic deliverable by developing hypotheses, conducting analyses, &nbsp; and collaborating with colleagues &nbsp;

• Collaborates on steroids with multidisciplinary teams (working closely with the creative lead, client lead &nbsp; and brand performance lead, as well as any required expertise or specialist) to identify client needs, &nbsp; articulate the story, develop recommendations, and presents to clients to gain buy-in &nbsp;

• Leads the writing and development of high-quality delivery such as integrated client presentations &nbsp;

• Generates strategies that inspire award-winning (D&amp;AD, The One Show, and Cannes Lions), breakthrough &nbsp; (talked about in the media and the industry) and impactful work &nbsp;

• Partners with others to map out and pursue opportunities to grow current client relationships &nbsp;

• Leads development of POVs for pitches and outbound new business efforts &nbsp;

• Fosters communication and cohesion between internal teams and disciplines &nbsp;

• Provides mentoring and on-the-job training for junior level talent. &nbsp;

• Responsible for individual performance management of direct reports, including continuous conversations and interim reviews &nbsp;

• Understanding of and commitment to targets and budget allocations &nbsp;

What you’ll need  &nbsp;

• 5-8 years in brand strategy at a design-led agency, branding consultancy, or CPG-focused shop, or client-side brand experience with agency-quality strategic craft

• Genuine CPG fluency - you understand penetration, mental and physical availability, category entry points, and why the answer to most CPG growth questions is "more buyers," not "more loyalty"

• Practical experience with semiotics and category code analysis; you can do it, not just define it

• Packaging strategy experience, including audit methodology and shelf-impact assessment

• Strong positioning and value proposition craft

• A real relationship with design; you know how to brief creative teams and how to give feedback that improves work rather than flattening it

The&nbsp;salary for this&nbsp;position at the time of this posting may range from $65,000 to $85,000. Individual compensation varies based on job related factors, including location, business needs, level of responsibility

About Us

“Capco, a Wipro company, is a global technology and management consulting firm. Awarded with Consultancy of the year in the British Bank Award and has been ranked Top 100 Best Companies for Women in India 2022 by Avtar &amp; Seramount . With our presence across 32 cities across globe, we support 100+ clients across&nbsp;banking, financial and Energy sectors. We are recognized for our deep transformation execution and delivery.&nbsp;

WHY JOIN CAPCO?

You will work on engaging projects with the largest international and local banks, insurance companies, payment service providers and other key players in the industry. The projects that will transform the financial services industry.

MAKE AN IMPACT

Innovative thinking, delivery excellence and thought leadership to help our clients transform their business. Together with our clients and industry partners, we deliver disruptive work that is changing energy and financial services.

#BEYOURSELFATWORK

Capco has a tolerant, open culture that values diversity, inclusivity, and creativity.

CAREER ADVANCEMENT

With no forced hierarchy at Capco, everyone has the opportunity to grow as we grow, taking their career into their own hands.

DIVERSITY &amp; INCLUSION

We believe that diversity of people and perspective gives us a competitive advantage.

